  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon seafood seasoning (such as Old Bay®), or to taste",
    "5 pounds new potatoes",
    "3 (16 ounce) packages cooked kielbasa sausage, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "8 ears fresh corn, husks and silks removed",
    "5 pounds whole crab, broken into pieces",
    "4 pounds fresh shrimp, peeled and deveined"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/05zX4pBwub_sLOG6j0fvwO9FQZ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-44033-daves-low-country-boil-step-01-cd2ce92633f74283b65ce154e42f874f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44033/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large pot of water over an outdoor cooker, or on the stovetop over medium-high heat. Add seafood seasoning to taste and bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yrtw3dh8LPOShIh4zv7hOhb6dcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-44033-daves-low-country-boil-step-02-b60a0d2b52734107ad1d371a24342272.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44033/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add potatoes and sausage and cook for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iSgpxvfTH6lSobiCX8oXKpsNK5o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-44033-daves-low-country-boil-step-03-4ecb963d508446a2bc76a43cc1553074.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44033/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Break corn ears in half; add corn and crab and cook for another 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yrZ5jm36ix5t-VU45tfavjwthJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-44033-daves-low-country-boil-step-04-9fd57bf9e90a4009bc83712c3cd6572e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44033/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add shrimp when potatoes are almost tender and everything else is almost done; cook until shrimp are just cooked through, 3 to 4 minutes longer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AOnvyRRk6bocvuTRA2S59U2nsb0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-44033-daves-low-country-boil-step-05-0bb017f5aacf40a4bc5582d7ec9a588d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44033/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain off and discard the water. Pour the contents out onto a picnic table covered with newspaper.",
